<pb facs="#f0764" n="730"/>
<p> <lb n="p1b_730.001"/>
7. <hi rendition="#aq">a a b c &#x2502; d d b c &#x2502; e c c e c</hi>.</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_730.002"/>
