20. <hi rendition="#aq">a b c &#x2502; a b c &#x2502; d e d e f f e</hi>.</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_731.027"/>
<hi rendition="#g">Beispiel:</hi> Der Vorige a. a. O. <hi rendition="#aq">I</hi>. 167. 34.</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_731.028"/>
21. <hi rendition="#aq">a b c d &#x2502; a b c e &#x2502; d f f g g</hi>.</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_731.029"/>
<hi rendition="#g">Beispiel:</hi> Heinrich v. Rugge (Hagens Minnes. <hi rendition="#aq">I</hi>. 221. 2).</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_731.030"/>
22. <hi rendition="#aq">a b a b &#x2502; c d c d &#x2502; e e f e f</hi>.</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_731.031"/>
<hi rendition="#g">Beispiel:</hi> Konrad v. Landegge (Hagens Minnes. <hi rendition="#aq">I</hi>. 356. 10).</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_731.032"/>
23. <hi rendition="#aq">a b c d &#x2502; a b a d &#x2502; e f e f f</hi>.</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_731.033"/>
<hi rendition="#g">Beispiel:</hi> Tanhuser (Hagens Minnes. <hi rendition="#aq">II</hi>. 90. 7).</p> <p> <lb n="p1b_731.034"/>
